    "b0004-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "e1f069c7768ef44649e56089e0d51bf038aae82ba30675c379ab758e441807d3",
      "targetHash": "4fbcf38bd183c03b6393a60a5f4e060a4546a72d7d0ed64f9db5845377030077",
      "machineHash": "4fbcf38bd183c03b6393a60a5f4e060a4546a72d7d0ed64f9db5845377030077",
      "machineText": "長久以來，我一直堅信 Microsoft 最終必須解決其瀏覽器的問題。世界持續向前，前端開發蓬勃發展，而 IE 已無法勝任。當 Microsoft 宣布改以 Chromium 作為新瀏覽器發展方向的基礎時，我知道 Wails 遲早能夠採用它，並將 Windows 上的開發體驗提升到全新層次。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "For a long time, I'd firmly believed that Microsoft would eventually have to\\ sort out their browser…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
