      "targetHash": "127a34f72fe2dd2cb6d7e9953cb1f6e4e1b7a7b44467ad47768d38c6db712999",
      "machineHash": "127a34f72fe2dd2cb6d7e9953cb1f6e4e1b7a7b44467ad47768d38c6db712999",
      "machineText": "今天，我很高興宣布：*Wails v2 Windows 版 Beta*！這個版本有大量內容值得深入介紹，所以請準備一杯飲料，坐下來，讓我們開始吧……",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Today, I am pleased to announce: *Wails v2 Beta for Windows*! There's a huge\\ amount to unpack in th…",
      "provider": "codex",
