      "targetHash": "0220a2200fbdf50628fabb961dad0ad0573771a27efc0b6d161001fc6abf18ac",
      "machineHash": "0220a2200fbdf50628fabb961dad0ad0573771a27efc0b6d161001fc6abf18ac",
      "machineText": "Windows 開發人員終於能為應用程式使用一流的轉譯引擎！再也不必費盡心思調整前端程式碼，才能讓它在 Windows 上運作。此外，還能享有一流的開發人員工具體驗！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Finally, Windows developers get a first class rendering engine for their\\ applications! Gone are the…",
