    "b0011-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "a609cec886b696e4b8e4f51e2a8d9a0b59966e9badb2f598a171cc7f1491aed9",
      "targetHash": "4b3c8bb21a15bc62c6c487edcbdbda99aa38d7098ec6dae1b5f9e69891fb6ac9",
      "machineHash": "4b3c8bb21a15bc62c6c487edcbdbda99aa38d7098ec6dae1b5f9e69891fb6ac9",
      "machineText": "不過，WebView2 元件確實要求將`WebView2Loader.dll`放在二進位檔旁。這讓散布流程比我們 Go 開發人員所習慣的稍微麻煩一些。據我所知，所有使用 WebView2 的解決方案和程式庫都有這項相依性。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The WebView2 component does, however, have a requirement to have the\\ `WebView2Loader.dll` sitting a…",
