      "targetHash": "7b0b4799833ca31edc1c4f1517d48fc24b4f8b6527a51bc818fa48015f6b3a6b",
      "machineHash": "7b0b4799833ca31edc1c4f1517d48fc24b4f8b6527a51bc818fa48015f6b3a6b",
      "machineText": "不過，我非常興奮地宣布，Wails 應用程式_完全沒有這項要求_！多虧了[John Chadwick](https://github.com/jchv)的巧妙技術，我們可以將這個 dll 封裝在二進位檔內，並讓 Windows 像它實際存在於磁碟上一樣載入它。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "However, I'm really excited to announce that Wails applications _have no such\\ requirement_! Thanks …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
