    "b0016-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "ccba28ca464ea452ce656e7d55d7353d57d8ce82ba5046eb678f01e99151fbb0",
      "targetHash": "626d79ea1ea11420c9545a0e9498f94e925b7f60fd83f274753e30792a5c158a",
      "machineHash": "626d79ea1ea11420c9545a0e9498f94e925b7f60fd83f274753e30792a5c158a",
      "machineText": "許多人要求支援原生選單，Wails 終於滿足了這項需求。現在已可使用應用程式選單，並支援大多數原生選單功能，包括標準選單項目、核取方塊、選項按鈕群組、子選單及分隔線。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "There were a lot of requests for native menu support. Wails has finally got you\\ covered. Applicatio…",
