      "machineHash": "96d7811d1a707e6b1178036067398dc6fb93e6a5d82dcfa403bab750aee7b3b5",
      "machineText": "由於資產現在不需要封裝，因此帶來了全新的開發體驗。新的`wails dev`命令會建置並執行應用程式，但不會使用`embed.FS`中的資產，而是直接從磁碟載入。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Now that assets don't need to be bundled, it's enabled a whole new development\\ experience. The new …",
