    "b0033-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "d011d90fb9ff0557dec77e87205e0636f2d1cf1b5ab76a9238bd390f6dad3631",
      "targetHash": "4af73b428a7aa0a4e404e64a59afd0e4325e7312eeeb9b92a564fdd91c96e88d",
      "machineHash": "4af73b428a7aa0a4e404e64a59afd0e4325e7312eeeb9b92a564fdd91c96e88d",
      "machineText": "使用 Go 開發應用程式時，我們習慣處理結構體。將結構體傳送至前端，並將其作為應用程式的狀態使用，通常很實用。在 v1 中，這項流程高度依賴手動操作，對開發者而言有些負擔。我很高興地宣布，在 v2 中，只要應用程式以開發模式執行，就會為所有作為繫結方法輸入或輸出參數的結構體自動產生 TypeScript 模型。如此一來，便能在兩端之間順暢交換資料模型。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In Go, we are used to dealing with structs in our applications. It's often\\ useful to send structs t…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0034-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "e4a6145b3a813cb9128eeed038c86ca46725187be24a9bb2ca09de244178097b",
      "targetHash": "da2a069b0405a928523d7b1092ee4194895509321f0018f7c656fed875fa9581",
      "machineHash": "da2a069b0405a928523d7b1092ee4194895509321f0018f7c656fed875fa9581",
      "machineText": "除此之外，系統還會動態產生另一個 JS 模組，封裝所有繫結方法。該模組會為這些方法提供 JSDoc，讓 IDE 能提供程式碼自動完成與提示。在封裝 Go 程式碼的自動產生模組中按下 Tab 鍵時，資料模型便會自動匯入，實在很酷！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In addition to this, another JS module is dynamically generated wrapping all\\ your bound methods. Th…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
