    "b0037-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "721e813afcbd80a8d17de197ccf2f10bff249a89c4365ad5c2e3a492b2efb8ea",
      "targetHash": "039a4964cc3d0c7434df28e2ff2b0863d5743c9e7660ba6de7d8969fac1afd5c",
      "machineHash": "039a4964cc3d0c7434df28e2ff2b0863d5743c9e7660ba6de7d8969fac1afd5c",
      "machineText": "讓應用程式快速啟動並開始運作，一直是 Wails 專案的主要目標。專案推出時，我們曾嘗試涵蓋當時許多現代框架：React、Vue 和 Angular。前端開發領域充滿各種強烈主張、發展迅速，也很難時時掌握最新動態！因此，我們發現基礎範本很快就會過時，造成維護上的難題。這也意味著我們無法為最新、最出色的技術堆疊提供酷炫的現代範本。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Getting an application up and running quickly was always a key goal for the\\ Wails project. When we …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0038-text-01": {
