      "targetHash": "dfb5b680514680f2d58365fbaa8080ef8b7255a523f1c3c418982aa223f28157",
      "machineHash": "dfb5b680514680f2d58365fbaa8080ef8b7255a523f1c3c418982aa223f28157",
      "machineText": "在 v2 中，我希望賦予社群更多自主能力，讓大家可以自行建立及託管範本，而不必依賴 Wails 專案。因此，你現在可以使用由社群支援的範本來建立專案！我希望這能激勵開發者打造充滿活力的專案範本生態系。我非常期待看到我們的開發者社群能創造出什麼成果！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "With v2, I wanted to empower the community by giving you the ability to create\\ and host templates y…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
