      "targetHash": "2920468c164495141880dbe851ebd563c0dc823185f96538503dc0d7a3710511",
      "machineHash": "2920468c164495141880dbe851ebd563c0dc823185f96538503dc0d7a3710511",
      "machineText": "我也要向以下人士致上萬分感謝 :pray:，因為若沒有他們，這個版本根本不會誕生：",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "I also need to give a huge thank you :pray: to the following people because\\ without them, this rele…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
